{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.BringHauptmodulGate","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BringHauptmodulGate","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BringHauptmodulGate.fricke_companion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BringHauptmodulGate.fricke_companion","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BringHauptmodulGate.lean#L69-L74","doc":"**Fricke companion.** The Fricke involution sends `t₅ ↦ 5³/t₅`; at `t₅(τ₀) = −10`\nthis gives `5³/(−10) = −25/2`, which is exactly the literature value `j(5τ₀) = −25/2`\n— an internal consistency check tying the two published j-invariants through the one\nrational hauptmodul value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BringHauptmodulGate.j_tau0_times_t5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BringHauptmodulGate.j_tau0_times_t5","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BringHauptmodulGate.lean#L62-L67","doc":"The defining relation in the `j = (t² + 250t + 3125)³ / t⁵` direction:\nat `t = −10` the numerator `(t² + 250t + 3125)³ = 725³` equals `j·t⁵` with\n`j = −121945/32`, i.e. `j(τ₀)·(−10)⁵ = 725³ = 381 078 125`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BringHauptmodulGate.hauptmodul_sextic_root_int","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BringHauptmodulGate.hauptmodul_sextic_root_int","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BringHauptmodulGate.lean#L56-L60","doc":"The ℤ-cleared form of the same root: `32·(t² + 250t + 3125)³ + 121945·t⁵ = 0`\nat `t = −10`, entirely over ℤ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BringHauptmodulGate.hauptmodul_sextic_root","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BringHauptmodulGate.hauptmodul_sextic_root","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BringHauptmodulGate.lean#L49-L54","doc":"**`t = −10` is a root of the level-5 sextic at `j(τ₀) = −121945/32`:**\n`(t² + 250t + 3125)³ + (121945/32)·t⁵ = 0` at `t = −10`. This is the exact-rational\ncontent of `t₅(τ₀) = −10`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}